
url: str
data: dict, but value as str not dict, form data, multipart/form-data, in the body
json: dict, use Content-Type application/json, in the body
params: dict, url parameters use Content-Type application/x-www-form-urlencoded, or multipart/form-data, concat url with parameters, name=john, age=30, http://x.org/a?name=john&age=30
headers: dict, Content-Type, Authorization
cookies: dict
files: dict, {'name': file-object} or {'name':file-tuple} for multipart encoding upload, multipart/form-data
auth: auth tuple,
timeout: timeout for server
allow_redirects: Boolean
proxies: proxy
verify: Boolean for verify server TLS certificate
stream: Boolean, streaming mode
cert: .pem file or (cert, key)

